 trouble with a broken supercharger and had to retire on the very first lap.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":7},{"lap":2,"text":"At the end of lap two Lehoux was still leading but was pushed hard by the rest of the field and his Bugatti started to overheat.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":5},{"lap":3,"text":"On the next lap Nuvolari passed Etancelin for second and then he went by Lehoux and grabbed the lead.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":3,"text":"Falchetto retires with a sticking throttle.","q":false,"c":6},{"lap":4,"text":"Soon Etancelin also passed the struggling Lehoux.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":5,"text":"On lap five Lehoux made a pit stop because his car was overheating.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":5},{"lap":6,"text":"Lehoux retires.","q":false,"c":5},{"lap":10,"text":"Nuvolari leads after 10 laps in 14m30s, Etancelin pressing; Moll and Braillard fight over third.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":15,"text":"Etancelin tried several times to pass Nuvolari before finally succeeding.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":20,"text":"After 20 laps Etancelin leads Nuvolari by a second; Moll is third, Sommer fourth.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":22,"text":"The duel for the lead went on at ever faster speeds","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":28,"text":"Nuvolari re-takes the lead; Etancelin, braking later and later, develops brake trouble and falls back.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":30,"text":"After 30 laps Nuvolari leads Etancelin by 23 seconds; Moll is about to be lapped, Sommer and Braillard are a lap down.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":40,"text":"At 40 laps Etancelin was still trying his best to hang on and had lost just another five seconds to Nuvolari, who was still pushing and had done the last ten laps in 13m59s.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":50,"text":"The next ten laps went even faster, 13m57s for Nuvolari versus Etancelin's 14 minutes. The gap between them was now 31 seconds.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":60,"text":"Etancelin loses another 8 seconds over laps 51-60.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":70,"text":"Etancelin's brakes really start to fail.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":80,"text":"Nuvolari wins; Etancelin, second, is the hero of the day.","q":false,"c":0}]}